        head: 'Close one cycle **first.**',
        body: 'Insights need a full payday-to-payday rhythm to mean anything.',
        cta: 'Open the ritual'
      },
      // DATA_INTELLIGENCE.md phase ④ — the honest provenance caption shown on a cycle card that was
